          "text": "Eye examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Left esotropia. No redness or discharge. Pupils equal and reactive; no obvious relative afferent pupillary defect. Extraocular movements grossly full; no new diplopia. Visual fields grossly full."
      }
    },
